    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I’m happy to be here today to share my experience with you. Three years ago, my doctor told me that I had to lose weight to stay healthy. So, I made up my mind that I would change my "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "lifestyle",
            "ref": "v-lifestyle"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "I believe that the key to losing weight is having a positive mind. During the past three years, whenever I faced difficulties, I would encourage myself. That’s how I could keep going."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Next, I had to change my diet. I threw away all of the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "junk food",
            "ref": "v-junk-food"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in my house. When I went shopping, I only bought healthy food for myself. I suggest that when you get home, you should check the food in your fridge. Will it help you become the healthy person you want to be?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Lastly, I also started exercising. I tried to get out of my room and spend more time outside. At first, it was difficult for me. But "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "as time went by",
            "ref": "v-as-time-went-by"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ", I started doing more and more exercise. Now, I’m able to run 5 kilometres every day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Losing weight is all about making the right choices for your health. I’ve made it. And I want to tell you that you can, too!"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
